---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RetailLinks from '../components/RetailLinks.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Perfectly in Sync | Perfect Sync Press" description="Perfectly in Sync by Joseph Juneau is an intimate memoir of love, desire, trust, and the private language two people build together.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Perfectly in Sync</p>
        <h1>A memoir of desire, trust, and being fully seen.</h1>
        <p class="lede">By Joseph Juneau</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#buy">Where to Buy</a>
          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="book-cover-wrap">
        <img class="book-cover" src="/assets/book-cover.png" alt="Perfectly in Sync book cover" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <aside class="quote-card compact">
        <p class="eyebrow">For readers drawn to</p>
        <h3>Erotic memoir. Emotionally layered desire. Intimacy as psychology.</h3>
      </aside>

      <div class="prose book-description">
        <p><em>Perfectly in Sync</em> is an intimate memoir of love, desire, trust, and the private language two people build together when they are willing to be fully seen.</p>

        <p>What begins as curiosity leads Joseph and Anna into the hidden world of the club, where watching becomes its own kind of intimacy, where jealousy sharpens instead of disappearing, and where pleasure, risk, and vulnerability reveal more than either of them expected. But this is not just a story about nightlife, sex, or novelty. It is the story of what those experiences opened between them.</p>

        <p>As they move through clubs, hotel rooms, fantasies, thresholds, and the quiet mornings after, they discover that the real experience was never the room itself. It was each other. The looks that lingered. The trust that deepened. The strange, powerful closeness of witnessing the other lose themselves and still finding their way back together.</p>

        <p>Sensual, honest, and deeply reflective, <em>Perfectly in Sync</em> explores what happens when two people stop hiding from what they want and start learning the shape of each other in full.</p>

        <p>For readers drawn to erotic memoir, emotionally layered desire, and stories where intimacy is as psychological as it is physical, this is a book about more than adventure. It is about connection, transformation, and the rare experience of finding someone who speaks your language before either of you has words for it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="buy">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Retailers</p>
      <h2>Where to buy</h2>
      <RetailLinks />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>